  "description": "Note: images are illustrative and visual guide purposes, final materials, fittings and finishes may vary.\n\nExceptional 4 bedroom detached family residence measuring approximately 174 sq meters, “A” energy rated efficient home \nAn exciting opportunity to acquire a beautifully designed 4-bedroom detached family home situated within the exclusive Castleknock Lawn development on the prestigious Beechpark Avenue, Castleknock.\nCurrently under construction, this impressive three-storey residence has been thoughtfully designed to maximise space, natural light and modern family living, while offering an exceptional standard of finish throughout. \n\n\nKey Features \n•\tNewly constructed 4 bedroom detached residence\n•\tSpacious accommodation extending to approx. 174 sq meters \n•\t“A” energy rated efficient design  \n•\tContemporary three-storey architectural design\n•\tHigh specification finish throughout with particular emphasis on space and light  \n•\tElegant handmade bespoke kitchen with premium finishes  \n•\tLuxury sanitary ware fitted throughout \n•\tHigh performance triple glazed Aluclad windows \n•\tGranite sills and wall caps\n•\tBright and spacious accommodation ideal for modern family living \n•\tPrivate south-facing rear garden, perfect for outdoor entertaining and family enjoyment \n•\tGenerous driveway and landscaped surroundings \n•\tLocated just off the highly sought-after Beechpark Avenue \n\n\nPerfectly positioned, Castleknock Lawn enjoys close proximity to an excellent range of local amenities including highly regarded primary and secondary schools, shops, cafes, restaurants, sporting clubs, and recreational facilities. Excellent transport links are also nearby with easy access to the M50 motorway, Castleknock Train Station, Dublin Bus services, and Dublin city centre.\n\nNow selling off plans, expected completion March 2027\nFor further information or to arrange a consultation regarding this exciting new development, please contact Newcombe Estates\n\n\nAccommodation\n\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance Hall:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\nLounge:  c.4.2x4.0m \t     \n\nKitchen/Dining Room:  c.6.7x5.1m\t     \n\nUtility Room:  c.2.5x2.0m\n\nGuest W.C: c.2.0x1.5m\n\n1st Floor \n\nBedroom 3:  c.4.0x3.4m \t     \n\nBedroom 4:  c.4.4x2.9m\n\t\nEnsuite: c.2.7x1.6m \t     \n\nBathroom:  c.2.6x1.8m\n\n2nd Floor \n\nBedroom 1:  c.5.8x3.2m\n\t\nEnsuite:   c.2.3x2.0m \t     \n\nBedroom 2:  c.3.4x2.5m\n\t\nStorage:  c.2.2x2.0m\n\n\nSpecifications \n\nKitchen \nThis home features a superb bespoke kitchen with integrated storage and quartz worktops.  A central island with quartz worktop for additional kitchen space\nFeature 2.7m ceiling height with quality tiled floor as standard \n\nUtility Room\nThe matching utility room features a hidden pantry and is plumbed for raised washing machine and tumble dryer \n\nWardrobes \nContemporary designed built in wardrobes are included in 4 bedrooms \n\nInternal Finishes\nWalls and ceilings are painted throughout with feature cornicing included in the ground floor hallway and living room \n\nBathroom & Ensuites \nMain bathroom and four ensuite shower rooms featuring porcelain sanitary wear with closed couple shrouded cistern and fittings \nWalk-in showers with feature rain head shower fittings\nBathroom features free standing bath tub and all feature luxury heated towel rails, LED mirrors and built-in drawers as standard \nThere is high quality tiling to wet areas and bathroom floors \n\nWindows & Doors \nNordan triple glazed aul clad windows with 30 year guarantee \nFeature double French doors to rear of home with wind lock mechanism \nFully reversible windows for everyday use and cleaning \nMarket leading thermal and acoustic performance these windows are robust and elegant \n\nVentilation & Heating System \n“A” rated air to water heat pump with heat recovery system supplying a constant stream of fresh air while recovering up to 90% of heat energy from the air expelled hereby greatly reducing heating costs\nThe system includes zoned heating for personalised comfort featuring under-floor heating at ground level with radiators to upper floor \n\nLighting & Electrical \nGenerous light power and USB charging points in key living areas \nCat 6 telecommunications wiring for high speed connectivity \nProvision for multiroom TV & broadband \nRecessed downlights in key living spaces \nEnergy efficient LED lighting throughout \n\nSecurity \nPre-wired for alarm and security system \n\nGardens \nWalled front garden with provision for electric gates \nLawns front and rear seeded \nStylish patio area with paved flags directly off kitchen overlooking rear garden\nElectric provision for garden shed \n\nHomebond \nThis home is covered by 10 year homebond latest defects insurance policy \n\nBER \n“A2” energy rated homes",
